1. Rustlantis
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Location in cuda-oxide:      crates/fuzzer/rustlantis/
Upstream project:            https://github.com/cbeuw/rustlantis
Copyright:                   (c) ETH Zurich and contributors
License:                     Apache-2.0 OR MIT (dual-licensed, at your option)

Rustlantis is a fuzzer for the Rust compiler, authored by Qian (Andy) Wang and
Ralf Jung (ETH Zurich). Its source is embedded in this repository under
`crates/fuzzer/rustlantis/` and is used to generate randomized MIR programs for
differential testing of the cuda-oxide codegen backend.

